  "flavor": "After a catalogue of misfortune, hard working residents on Drodo Island are making their efforts on reconstruction. Guided by Archdruid Leshrac, nature protectors are busy recovering structures and vegetation, nourishing everything. While the master of magic - Cogliostro, with his magicians, are also devoted to transformation magic. inspired by the Wheel of Wonders, they revealed a far more powerful magic of space transformation. Who will be the superstar in the coming new season?",
